WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.190
- What I'll do is name
a location in New York

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:05.190
and Tracy will tell us his
personal history behind it.

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.130
Here we go. Are you ready?

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:08.330
- Ready.
- Okay. The Bronx Zoo.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.087
- I got lost in the Bronx Zoo
when I was about 11 years old.

00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:12.010
(audience laughing)

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:13.113
I got lost.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:18.550
I went with the camp, and my
guardian's name was Spencer,

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.140
and we got in the zoo,

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.320
and he told us not to feed
nothing, none of the animals.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:24.420
What did little Tracy do?

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.900
I started throwing food at the chimpanzee.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.800
He hit me with a switch on my
back and I ran and I was lost,

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:31.930
but then they found me about
two, three hours later.

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:32.870
- Okay, in your defense,

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:33.820
he hit you with a switch on your back.

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:35.920
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:36.980
- I'd have left too.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:38.853
Okay, wait. The old Yankee Stadium.

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:44.070
- I met my first wife
Sabina Morgan at gate four

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:46.590
because I worked at gate
four scalping tickets.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:50.693
I scalped tickets and I sold
souvenirs and I sold pretzels.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:54.950
I sold everything at gate four,

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:58.320
and also, that's where I
honed in on my sense of humor.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.730
That's when I honed in on
my craft, selling souvenirs.

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:02.563
- [Kelly] That's awesome.

00:01:02.563 --> 00:01:05.411
- I overcharged Lorne Michaels about $14.

00:01:05.411 --> 00:01:06.610
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.060
Lorne, I owe you $14 for little bags.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.174
- Little... Okay! (laughs)

